            <div xml:id="m-791c9ea9-34ef-4eab-880a-7bf4279bbeef">
              <lg xml:id="m-22f4d02f-7091-4a33-a450-379f1ff32e1a">
                <l xml:id="m-e02d903f-cfc5-4f89-b530-a9b5d3fb0354" facs="#m-93c05edd-6fed-4568-9529-cc9c6675ead0" label="ambiguous">154</l><l xml:id="m-258703dd-9ed9-4526-a2df-60aa305b25bf" facs="#m-b24f48da-4758-4d5d-8872-f4e06c75bd9c" label="ambiguous">In exitu. 3. a.</l><l xml:id="m-9321f38b-351f-41ec-b653-85a2cf1a4026" facs="#m-97b248b8-66f3-4eeb-9a83-621763b30627" label="lyrics-like">18. Dómus Aaron sperávit in Dómino:“ adjútor eórum et protéctor</l><l xml:id="m-5ac1af0c-cbbc-4dc8-b8f5-802b79fa3551" facs="#m-f583504a-3b3d-4347-b56e-a4d258b843c0" label="lyrics-like">córum est.</l><l xml:id="m-d41e46da-412e-4dd1-88b0-8bd22cd00e64" facs="#m-6fadee76-3724-4afe-9f3f-ffe9000dadb2" label="lyrics-like">19. Qui tíment Dóminum speravérunt in Dómino : * adjútor eórum et</l><l xml:id="m-bc8365ac-f8c3-4472-af5e-3317bce9851d" facs="#m-67d21c29-3e56-4e04-be71-42a262719fb2" label="lyrics-like">protéctor eórum est.</l><l xml:id="m-8a50094a-c841-40cb-ac5e-757a88967892" facs="#m-08fe08cd-b56b-458d-8e42-142362b8fbbe" label="lyrics-like">20. Dóminus mémor fuit nóstri :*et benedixit nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-e44c6b7b-cc2a-4b26-a421-77ef1c9e83bd" facs="#m-a844fcb8-30b9-4683-aed1-2840d1830e4a" label="lyrics-like">21. Benedixit dómui Israel :* benedíxit dómui Aaron.</l><l xml:id="m-3bfc213a-98fc-4dd8-be61-f4bc8dbf600c" facs="#m-1cc6a82c-0c9c-480d-9693-c0f07efd8a9b" label="lyrics-like">22. Benedíxit ómnibus qui timent Dóminum, * pusillis cum majóribus.</l><l xml:id="m-40bfec20-ace4-4d57-9c5e-e8cc24c7e6e8" facs="#m-ac201f45-ab18-4717-ad08-69ddacf6d9e3" label="lyrics-like">23. Adiiciat Dóminus súper vos: * super vos, et super filios véstros.</l><l xml:id="m-33e41564-45e1-4fb4-a54c-168c3a7ed9c3" facs="#m-10e7e704-b0cf-4c1b-89a5-062da0d01328" label="lyrics-like">24. Benedicti vos a Dómino, * qui fécit caélum et térram.</l><l xml:id="m-dd381382-ce60-4cbf-9fdd-92da0a64848f" facs="#m-8d9e242b-64aa-4030-9a03-2eab2619f254" label="lyrics-like">25. Caélum caéli Dómino: *térram autem dédit filits hóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-ec3d34c5-0e7e-40d8-877b-b6d56adad793" facs="#m-3d6d338e-ce13-4b86-a103-ed48377c3d06" label="lyrics-like">26. Non mórtui laudábunt te Dómine:"neque ómnes qui descéndunt</l><l xml:id="m-a272f13c-1a5d-430e-8932-1ca4780e6a21" facs="#m-9f819709-1464-4eec-86fb-9dc18c2cf4af" label="lyrics-like">in inférnum.</l><l xml:id="m-d9e3d5e5-84e2-47ca-964f-6a71322a73f6" facs="#m-ebc78ea1-d028-41f4-a941-9fd15636ab9e" label="lyrics-like">27. Sed nos qui vívimus, benedícimus Dómino, * ex hoc nunc et usque</l><l xml:id="m-b2ec300f-c955-4754-8332-2f4f8d9fcc20" facs="#m-b1f25f8d-a9ab-4ec8-95f3-76f9d8fa42b7" label="lyrics-like">in saéculum.</l><l xml:id="m-84d411ff-d837-44d7-9c06-bceddcb6b10e" facs="#m-ca9c13c3-3b2a-43d3-871c-32be18cb7ca8" label="lyrics-like">28. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-52d9e266-d72e-4314-852d-3bc07d46d0b1" facs="#m-fd1244fa-78b3-49db-816e-f9f932ba427d" label="lyrics-like">29. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-07e484ab-dd4d-4f36-8634-4713bddc80f3" facs="#m-fa2526f2-cf43-4811-a6fb-7b6cbf9f50c5" label="lyrics-like">lóram. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-32258703-582c-4ea2-8131-cdfbb692e1b6" facs="#m-bd586623-71c0-47e5-950b-0f51d6138481" label="ambiguous">Tone 8. a.</l><l xml:id="m-b3089ca3-869a-4816-a06e-b0bb7ed29157" facs="#m-24151fdf-2b37-4213-9d95-7f040b71f44b" label="text-like">Mediant of a accents (with an extra note Ending of 1 accent with I prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-340f9039-5a20-4495-a919-a4c6f58aa687" facs="#m-ecc53d85-1785-41a8-a799-02c72748b5b8" label="text-like">in anticipation of the accent in dactylic tory syllable.</l><l xml:id="m-89a88391-b204-4091-8dc7-c9a1566a12d4" facs="#m-81b08e79-14e7-4f56-9497-2643dc9c181d" label="ambiguous">cadences).</l><l xml:id="m-775336cd-1e29-4e7a-80b7-61ac7e93bde6" facs="#m-c6e6ff7f-e67c-48b3-a54c-66f57ac4f0e3" label="lyrics-like">1. In éxi-tu Isra-el de Ae-gypto, * dómus Jácob de pópu-lo bárba¬</l><l xml:id="m-2e1bb023-5d6a-4310-a381-c173ffbd3837" facs="#m-d4b298d5-cc77-4d78-8191-95cb5e07a041" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-f38a810d-bfcd-4235-a356-3a6d1c0f539e" facs="#m-bd1d615b-24e2-4a8a-8ff9-1500ac9ed611" label="lyrics-like">ro. Flex: palpábunt:t</l><l xml:id="m-322333bd-cf26-4db4-84e5-cb4e62351294" facs="#m-fc422f62-2ff2-4fad-8aef-803c1693a113" label="lyrics-like">2. Fácta est Judaéa sanctifieátio éjus, “Israel potéstas éius.</l><l xml:id="m-7f726912-4478-4c2f-b51e-86b4fe9b1bce" facs="#m-97654dc4-e4e2-4f77-80d7-defbc9c2e794" label="lyrics-like">3. Mâre vidit, et fúgit:*Jordánis convérsus est retrórsum.</l><l xml:id="m-8aa10319-f663-456e-b2ed-abae4fb360b6" facs="#m-c04108e0-c0e9-4f2a-8f7c-6440cafd518d" label="lyrics-like">4. Móntes exsultavérunt ut arietes:"et cólles sicut ágni óvium.</l><l xml:id="m-a8ccd7da-6b6a-4579-af38-3618de1d17b8" facs="#m-85cb2d01-0a64-458f-8c1b-e4cf0b6c70b7" label="lyrics-like">5. Quid est tibi máre quod fugisti? * et tu Jordánis, quia convérsus</l><l xml:id="m-c21b646c-4642-4cdf-8f78-4a3dd5f7c017" facs="#m-61669aa0-da96-4194-9577-4602e108424b" label="lyrics-like">es retrórsum?</l><l xml:id="m-05ca5217-ae38-48da-b3f2-734faa75f9e6" facs="#m-1658ade8-6ce4-438f-a07d-765a2a8c6260" label="lyrics-like">6. Móntes exsultástis sieut arietes, *et cólles sicut ágni óvium?</l><l xml:id="m-e1923fd3-8b9c-4ef8-89c6-161ec88c336b" facs="#m-de73e355-38a4-4767-9acc-a38249fc3200" label="lyrics-like">7. A fácie Dómini móta est térra, “a fácie Dét Jácob:</l><l xml:id="m-d08952ae-6011-4f1d-9fe0-8c87b8492f91" facs="#m-853d5548-8a95-4930-b8f9-000dd68285ef" label="lyrics-like">8. Qui convértit pétram in stágna aquárum, * et rúpem in fóntes</l><l xml:id="m-8b06dd98-4652-4ba2-b912-9ad1e2e58048" facs="#m-cb968804-67ab-40f8-81a3-3f91ae1c06ed" label="lyrics-like">aquárum.</l><l xml:id="m-5efc4a64-6a4d-47e8-a1ed-d96e3cbf625c" facs="#m-8a606cc9-263b-4c86-8c05-e37ea265f85c" label="lyrics-like">9. Non nóbis Dómine, non nóbis: * sed nómini túo da glóriam.</l><l xml:id="m-ffadd6ed-3724-46db-83b5-f52f7ec39f73" facs="#m-86fdb778-dee3-4747-9662-769268a080e4" label="lyrics-like">10. Super misericórdia túa et veritáte túa:* nequándo dicant géntes:</l><l xml:id="m-c2ca9016-878d-4b69-acc6-bbfe14ecf533" facs="#m-1efb2ff7-54e2-4a1c-88a5-017a94c90965" label="lyrics-like">Ubi est Déus eórum?</l><l xml:id="m-bca82a95-e45c-47f2-9f7b-ddb333a16da7" facs="#m-d7e1a0e4-b014-4ddf-8197-b7b4acc9ad12" label="lyrics-like">11. Déus autem nóster in caélo:* ómnia quaecúmque vóluit, fécit</l><l xml:id="m-1b575553-44a3-4ad0-8f56-498851a9cf15" facs="#m-1f0e1472-883b-4434-a35a-9bd8afb17231" label="lyrics-like">12. Simulácra géntium argéntum et áurum, * ópera mánuum</l><l xml:id="m-29777cb3-7aad-49f0-873d-b141ad2e66fe" facs="#m-0cebb977-ca6d-4da0-9bf5-99952ee0e34c" label="lyrics-like">hóminum.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>